1
00:00:22,230 --> 00:00:23,390
I've spent my whole life

2
00:00:23,390 --> 00:00:25,050
drawing precise blueprints,

3
00:00:25,390 --> 00:00:28,280
but I can't draw clear boundaries in life.

4
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:33,470
Right and wrong are clear in blueprints,

5
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:36,640
but human hearts and life itself

6
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:39,280
are all shades of gray.

7
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:44,200
This space between black and white

8
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:46,790
is never a place to linger.

9
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:48,680
It's purgatory,

10
00:00:51,710 --> 00:00:53,070
and I've been

11
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:55,560
trapped in it for a long time,

12
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:59,150
unable to move forward or go back.

13
00:00:59,170 --> 00:01:00,410
Chen...

14
00:02:33,470 --> 00:02:38,240
[LIGHT THE DARK]

15
00:02:38,700 --> 00:02:41,430
[Episode 2]

16
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,240
They thought

17
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,240
they could just find someone

18
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,280
to send me away,

19
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:46,900
and I wouldn't know

20
00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:48,150
what kind of conspiracy

21
00:02:48,150 --> 00:02:49,280
they were plotting?

22
00:02:49,750 --> 00:02:50,520
You weren't there.

23
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:51,560
How do you know

24
00:02:51,710 --> 00:02:52,960
what they said?

25
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:54,310
I... I've been in the plant

26
00:02:54,310 --> 00:02:55,310
for so many years.

27
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:57,010
Even if I weren't there,

28
00:02:57,190 --> 00:02:58,920
I could still get information.

29
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:02,860
They just wanted to

30
00:03:02,910 --> 00:03:04,590
shift the responsibility

31
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,000
for the Project 713 accident

32
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,120
onto Chen Fu.

33
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:10,080
Do you know what charge they made up?

34
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:11,280
Improper operation.

35
00:03:12,470 --> 00:03:13,280
How wicked.

36
00:03:13,710 --> 00:03:15,220
The whole plant knows

37
00:03:15,590 --> 00:03:16,920
Chen Fu is good at his job

38
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:18,690
and has principles.

39
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:19,840
If they try to
pin the blame on him like this,

40
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:21,240
no one will believe them.

41
00:03:21,430 --> 00:03:23,400
They're using Chen Fu as a scapegoat.

42
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,120
Do you know why

43
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,450
they didn't ask me to go?

44
00:03:26,750 --> 00:03:27,400
Because they know

45
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:29,329
my relationship with your family.

46
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:32,800
If I had been there,
I would have definitely objected.

47
00:03:35,150 --> 00:03:35,910
Wenying.

48
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:37,850
You usually

49
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:40,400
are quite close to the director.

50
00:03:41,079 --> 00:03:42,410
Whatever they are up to,

51
00:03:42,710 --> 00:03:44,310
you should have an idea.

52
00:03:44,910 --> 00:03:45,910
Geng Jian, I...

53
00:03:45,910 --> 00:03:46,710
-I know. I know.
-I...

54
00:03:46,710 --> 00:03:47,590
I know...

55
00:03:47,870 --> 00:03:49,470
I know what you're thinking.

56
00:03:49,590 --> 00:03:51,320
-You don't need to tell me.
-No.

57
00:03:51,470 --> 00:03:52,930
I said those words just now

58
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:54,360
to prepare you

59
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,620
for what might happen.

60
00:04:12,310 --> 00:04:14,030
I didn't find Dad's work notes

61
00:04:14,030 --> 00:04:15,430
or the flange fragments.

62
00:04:16,190 --> 00:04:17,510
But I found this.

63
00:04:27,190 --> 00:04:28,650
This is a gift Dad gave you.

64
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:35,360
Shan.

65
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:38,420
I know you're going
to work in Guangdong.

66
00:04:38,630 --> 00:04:39,680
I support you.

67
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:40,870
Go for it.

68
00:05:06,670 --> 00:05:10,760
Dad bought this for me to learn English.

69
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,740
Thanks to this gift,

70
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:21,910
I recorded some

71
00:05:21,930 --> 00:05:22,860
crucial things.

72
00:05:23,950 --> 00:05:24,790
Today,

73
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:26,720
Wan Yang gathered his own people

74
00:05:27,270 --> 00:05:28,730
and held a secret meeting.

75
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:29,950
Listen.

76
00:05:35,510 --> 00:05:36,600
Alright, today all departments

77
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,600
are in agreement.

78
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:39,800
The Project 713 explosion

79
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:42,460
was caused
by improper operation on the part

80
00:05:42,510 --> 00:05:44,800
-of Chen Fu from the construction team.
-They're slandering him!

81
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:45,950
Captain Chen Fu...

82
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,320
Keep your voice down!

83
00:05:47,630 --> 00:05:49,030
They clearly want to blame everything

84
00:05:49,030 --> 00:05:49,830
on Dad.

85
00:05:50,830 --> 00:05:53,190
They even thought of
all kinds of countermeasures.

86
00:05:53,190 --> 00:05:54,450
I'm going to find them.

87
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:55,480
Shan!

88
00:05:55,630 --> 00:05:56,430
Shan!

89
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:58,330
Shan, don't be impulsive!

90
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:00,270
Godfather?

91
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:06,950
From now on, this family will have to

92
00:06:07,510 --> 00:06:09,120
rely on you two.

93
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:11,780
Take good care of your mother.

94
00:06:13,070 --> 00:06:14,670
It's okay. You still have me.

95
00:06:16,270 --> 00:06:17,310
I'll go back now.

96
00:06:18,070 --> 00:06:19,130
Shan, I'm leaving.

97
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:25,380
Take care, Godfather.

98
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:29,270
Mom.

99
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:32,310
The food is ready. Have some.

100
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:34,920
You guys eat first.

101
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:36,330
I'm going out for a walk.

102
00:06:36,510 --> 00:06:37,490
I'll go with you.

103
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:39,250
No, I'll be right back.

104
00:07:00,270 --> 00:07:01,070
Wenying.

105
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:04,310
It's so late.

106
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,870
Why are you not taking care of yourself?

107
00:07:06,870 --> 00:07:09,240
You look terrible right now.

108
00:07:10,510 --> 00:07:11,360
Was Chen Fu...

109
00:07:13,270 --> 00:07:14,630
killed by you?

110
00:07:23,510 --> 00:07:25,310
Wenying, you really are sick.

111
00:07:25,310 --> 00:07:26,950
Are you out of your mind?

112
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:28,030
Think about it.

113
00:07:28,050 --> 00:07:30,040
We've known each other for so many years

114
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:31,970
and been through so much together.

115
00:07:32,270 --> 00:07:34,240
I've always trusted you.

116
00:07:35,070 --> 00:07:36,930
Did it really have to come to this?

117
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:40,159
After I called you,

118
00:07:40,950 --> 00:07:43,010
Chen Fu was called out.

119
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:44,190
I saw with my own eyes

120
00:07:44,190 --> 00:07:45,800
that he got into Sun Jie's car.

121
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:47,120
You sent him.

122
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:48,800
You and Sun Jie

123
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,190
-killed him to silence him!
-Zhang Wenying!

124
00:07:50,190 --> 00:07:52,590
You need to be responsible
for what you say!

125
00:07:53,430 --> 00:07:54,830
Chen passed away, and you're sick.

126
00:07:54,830 --> 00:07:56,070
I've been tolerant,

127
00:07:56,070 --> 00:07:56,780
but that doesn't mean

128
00:07:56,780 --> 00:07:58,909
you can be presumptuous in front of me!

129
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:01,950
Let me tell you!

130
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:04,970
I never wanted to kill Chen Fu.

131
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:10,800
Ying.

132
00:08:11,270 --> 00:08:12,510
We can't let Dad

133
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:13,800
be wronged like this.

134
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:15,160
We have to take action.

135
00:08:15,270 --> 00:08:16,360
What do you think?

136
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,140
Based on the recording

137
00:08:19,310 --> 00:08:20,870
and Dad's unusual reaction

138
00:08:20,870 --> 00:08:22,390
when he took me to the site that day,

139
00:08:22,390 --> 00:08:23,190
I suspect

140
00:08:23,510 --> 00:08:24,600
Wan Yang and his men took

141
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,360
the expensive alloy steel flanges

142
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:27,240
and replaced them

143
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:28,430
with cheap carbon steel ones,

144
00:08:28,430 --> 00:08:29,360
causing the explosion

145
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:30,360
that killed Dad.

146
00:08:30,430 --> 00:08:32,909
But these are just my guesses.

147
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:34,840
If we call the police now,

148
00:08:35,030 --> 00:08:36,120
Wan Yang and his men might take

149
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:37,200
the defective flanges

150
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:39,730
and destroy them all
to cover up the evidence.

151
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:40,789
By then,

152
00:08:40,870 --> 00:08:42,270
it will be even harder

153
00:08:42,390 --> 00:08:43,520
to clear Dad's name.

154
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:47,050
We can't let Dad take the blame.

155
00:08:48,030 --> 00:08:50,290
We have to find a way
to find out the truth.

156
00:08:50,670 --> 00:08:51,630
Then we need to find

157
00:08:51,630 --> 00:08:53,870
the defective flanges as soon as possible,

158
00:08:53,870 --> 00:08:55,790
as well as Dad's work notes.

159
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:57,240
Yes.

160
00:08:57,750 --> 00:08:59,270
I made the call that day.

161
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:02,390
I sent Sun Jie to pick him up.

162
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:03,870
You said Chen

163
00:09:03,870 --> 00:09:05,470
found the pipeline problem.

164
00:09:05,750 --> 00:09:07,480
I wanted to talk to him in person

165
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:09,020
and ask him not to report it.

166
00:09:09,020 --> 00:09:10,550
That wouldn't be good for anyone.

167
00:09:10,550 --> 00:09:12,080
But before he could arrive here,

168
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:13,130
he received a call

169
00:09:13,150 --> 00:09:14,440
from the construction team,

170
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:15,320
saying there was another

171
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,440
hidden safety hazard.

172
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:17,510
He immediately got out of the car

173
00:09:17,510 --> 00:09:18,750
and went to the site for inspection.

174
00:09:18,750 --> 00:09:19,960
I thought after he finished his business,

175
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,320
he would come back to me.

176
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:23,670
Who would have thought Chen Fu would die?

177
00:09:26,750 --> 00:09:27,640
Let me tell you

178
00:09:27,660 --> 00:09:29,060
a simple truth, Wenying.

179
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:31,000
As you know,

180
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:33,200
I don't know much about technology.

181
00:09:33,670 --> 00:09:34,510
How was I supposed to know

182
00:09:34,510 --> 00:09:36,510
when and where

183
00:09:36,510 --> 00:09:38,040
to make the pipeline explode

184
00:09:38,040 --> 00:09:39,700
just as Chen Fu was passing by?

185
00:09:43,510 --> 00:09:44,600
This explosion,

186
00:09:44,670 --> 00:09:46,390
like the previous ones,

187
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,890
was just an engineering accident.

188
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:50,180
It was an accident.

189
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:02,120
Shan,

190
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:03,700
did you find anything?

191
00:10:05,550 --> 00:10:07,560
Before inspecting the site,

192
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:09,420
they must have cleaned it up.

193
00:10:09,750 --> 00:10:11,630
They cleaned it up completely,

194
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:13,630
leaving no trace at all.

195
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:16,480
Think about where else

196
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:17,680
there could be clues.

197
00:10:19,750 --> 00:10:21,080
There is one more place.

198
00:10:23,790 --> 00:10:25,150
I'm about to retire.

199
00:10:26,030 --> 00:10:27,720
I need a smooth landing.

200
00:10:28,270 --> 00:10:29,930
Why would I get myself

201
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:31,320
into so much trouble?

202
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,200
Before the accident,

203
00:10:37,270 --> 00:10:39,360
you asked me to suggest a remedy.

204
00:10:40,390 --> 00:10:41,520
I've made up my mind.

205
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:43,920
Maybe I should listen to you.

206
00:10:44,750 --> 00:10:45,750
Over the years,

207
00:10:47,150 --> 00:10:49,210
everyone has gotten to know you well.

208
00:10:49,550 --> 00:10:51,350
You never stand in anyone's way.

209
00:10:51,510 --> 00:10:53,910
You work hard
and ask for nothing in return.

210
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:56,260
You have a lot of respect in the plant.

211
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,150
I promise

212
00:10:57,750 --> 00:11:00,000
I will definitely help you
before I retire,

213
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:01,550
so you can be more than just

214
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:04,050
a design department director.

215
00:11:08,510 --> 00:11:09,840
But you shouldn't

216
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:11,980
let Chen take the blame.

217
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:15,000
Chen had been a decent man all his life.

218
00:11:15,150 --> 00:11:16,510
You can't let him

219
00:11:16,510 --> 00:11:18,510
have a bad reputation after he dies.

220
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:20,320
I know you're sad,

221
00:11:22,030 --> 00:11:23,630
but Chen is gone.

222
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:24,790
Sacrificing him

223
00:11:24,790 --> 00:11:28,200
would be the best outcome for everyone.

224
00:11:32,510 --> 00:11:34,240
Chen Ying is still in the plant.

225
00:11:34,630 --> 00:11:35,960
In the future, Chen Shan

226
00:11:36,510 --> 00:11:38,840
will also need to come in
and make a living.

227
00:11:41,490 --> 00:11:44,350
You have to think about
your children's future.

228
00:12:14,510 --> 00:12:15,750
Hurry, pack it up.

229
00:12:17,030 --> 00:12:17,720
Let's go.

230
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:18,360
Let's go.

231
00:12:23,630 --> 00:12:24,490
Zhang Wenying.

232
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:28,720
This time, when the flanges were changed,

233
00:12:28,720 --> 00:12:31,120
although you didn't put anything
in your pocket,

234
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:33,440
you knowingly assisted.

235
00:12:34,360 --> 00:12:35,760
Besides, over the years,

236
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:38,030
whenever you asked for something,

237
00:12:38,150 --> 00:12:39,600
I agreed if I could.

238
00:12:39,750 --> 00:12:40,750
To put it bluntly,

239
00:12:41,390 --> 00:12:43,510
we are in the same boat.

240
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:45,240
Once something happens,

241
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:47,600
we're all doomed.

242
00:12:50,510 --> 00:12:52,570
Go back and think about it carefully.

243
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:53,960
I believe

244
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:56,440
you'll figure it out.

245
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:07,720
The meeting on the Project 713 accident

246
00:13:05,870 --> 00:13:12,160
[Wugang Petrochemical Plant]

247
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:08,960
will be held at 2:00 PM

248
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:10,720
in the plant cafeteria.

249
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:13,080
Department heads
should strengthen their study

250
00:13:12,250 --> 00:13:16,660
[Staff Cafeteria]

251
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:14,510
of safety regulations in the future.

252
00:13:14,510 --> 00:13:16,750
Every Friday at 3:00 PM, there will be

253
00:13:16,750 --> 00:13:19,360
safety training in the plant cafeteria.

254
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:21,510
Please attend on time.

255
00:13:21,510 --> 00:13:23,240
No one from the Chen family came.

256
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:25,240
I guess Zhang Wenying
has completely figured it out

257
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:26,770
and persuaded the two kids.

258
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:28,960
Let's begin.

259
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:37,600
Quiet down, everyone!

260
00:13:37,600 --> 00:13:38,200
Stop talking!

261
00:13:38,200 --> 00:13:39,400
The Director is here!

262
00:13:48,150 --> 00:13:48,960
Everyone.

263
00:13:50,510 --> 00:13:51,270
Today, we're holding

264
00:13:51,270 --> 00:13:53,480
an internal self-inspection meeting

265
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:55,890
regarding the pipeline explosion

266
00:13:56,510 --> 00:13:59,720
at the Wuxin Section of Project 713.

267
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:02,360
If anyone has any concerns or requests,

268
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:04,440
let's put everything on the table

269
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:05,360
and make things clear.

270
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:08,200
We'll report all the problems
and potential risks we uncover

271
00:14:06,540 --> 00:14:07,160
[Project 713 Pipeline Explosion]

272
00:14:07,190 --> 00:14:08,540
[Investigation and Accountability Meeting]

273
00:14:08,670 --> 00:14:11,320
to the accident investigation team
truthfully.

274
00:14:11,320 --> 00:14:12,510
Let me start.

275
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:14,200
Over the past few days,

276
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:15,600
our supply department has conducted

277
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:17,750
a thorough internal review

278
00:14:17,910 --> 00:14:20,150
and issued a self-inspection report.

279
00:14:20,200 --> 00:14:21,600
I can tell you

280
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:22,800
with full confidence

281
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:24,390
that our department's

282
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:27,030
equipment quality and inventory list

283
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:28,270
have both

284
00:14:28,270 --> 00:14:29,600
stood up to scrutiny.

285
00:14:29,790 --> 00:14:32,320
There's absolutely nothing wrong
with them.

286
00:14:32,430 --> 00:14:34,600
I've only recently taken over
the design department.

287
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:35,840
So far,

288
00:14:35,910 --> 00:14:36,720
I haven't found

289
00:14:36,720 --> 00:14:37,850
any major problems.

290
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:39,600
If anything comes up later,

291
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:40,840
I'll report it

292
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:41,750
immediately.

293
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:48,270
I am the deputy captain
of the construction team,

294
00:14:48,270 --> 00:14:49,120
He Jianchuan.

295
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:50,910
As for the construction team's affairs,

296
00:14:50,910 --> 00:14:52,270
I rarely get involved.

297
00:14:52,270 --> 00:14:55,510
Captain Chen was the one
making all the decisions.

298
00:14:56,630 --> 00:14:58,830
He just wants to shirk responsibility.

299
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:00,410
What did you say?

300
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:02,150
I said

301
00:15:02,150 --> 00:15:03,960
he is shirking responsibility.

302
00:15:04,030 --> 00:15:06,240
-Right!
-Right!

303
00:15:06,670 --> 00:15:09,720
I have a
self-inspection appraisal report here.

304
00:15:13,480 --> 00:15:14,960
I swear on my honor

305
00:15:15,790 --> 00:15:17,240
that this explosion

306
00:15:17,270 --> 00:15:20,840
was caused by Captain Chen's

307
00:15:20,910 --> 00:15:22,110
improper operation.

308
00:15:23,790 --> 00:15:25,240
Our Captain Chen was known

309
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:27,170
for his competence and integrity.

310
00:15:27,200 --> 00:15:28,450
He had always put safety

311
00:15:28,450 --> 00:15:29,510
first!

312
00:15:29,510 --> 00:15:29,960
Right!

313
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:30,390
Our Captain Chen

314
00:15:30,390 --> 00:15:31,960
had absolutely no problems.

315
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:32,840
Anyone who accuses him

316
00:15:32,840 --> 00:15:33,670
is framing him!

317
00:15:33,670 --> 00:15:34,670
Am I right, everyone?

318
00:15:34,670 --> 00:15:35,480
Right!

319
00:15:35,520 --> 00:15:36,770
It's a frame-up!

320
00:15:38,270 --> 00:15:38,840
Exactly!

321
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:40,700
Whoever has evidence

322
00:15:40,880 --> 00:15:42,150
can bring it out.

323
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:44,180
Let's confront each other face to face.

324
00:15:44,180 --> 00:15:45,670
Is that okay?

325
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:50,510
This appraisal

326
00:15:51,270 --> 00:15:52,790
is very detailed.

327
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:56,360
Does anyone else have evidence to provide?

328
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:02,080
Alright, since there's none, then...

329
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:03,090
I have evidence!

330
00:16:06,870 --> 00:16:08,000
These past few days,

331
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:09,260
we visited the hospital

332
00:16:09,260 --> 00:16:10,660
and the family quarters.

333
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:12,690
This is a collective statement

334
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:15,960
-from the workers at the hospital.
-Director Wan.

335
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:17,120
They can prove

336
00:16:17,240 --> 00:16:19,320
that my father's construction work

337
00:16:19,510 --> 00:16:20,750
was fully compliant with the procedures

338
00:16:20,750 --> 00:16:21,750
and had no issues.

339
00:16:22,750 --> 00:16:23,780
Take a look.

340
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:25,340
Everyone, take a look!

341
00:16:25,790 --> 00:16:27,670
One or two people saying it
might not be credible,

342
00:16:27,670 --> 00:16:29,170
but if everyone says so,

343
00:16:29,240 --> 00:16:30,510
my dad was definitely innocent!

344
00:16:30,510 --> 00:16:31,200
Right!

345
00:16:30,850 --> 00:16:32,040
[Project 713 Pipeline Explosion]

346
00:16:31,870 --> 00:16:33,560
You can't blame us
every time something goes wrong!

347
00:16:32,070 --> 00:16:32,710
[Investigation and Accountability Meeting]

348
00:16:33,630 --> 00:16:35,790
What kind of evidence is this?

349
00:16:36,320 --> 00:16:38,050
You are just acting on emotion.

350
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:39,510
You just put people's words

351
00:16:39,510 --> 00:16:41,080
in writing.

352
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:42,440
Acting on emotion?

353
00:16:42,480 --> 00:16:43,520
Nonsense!

354
00:16:43,870 --> 00:16:44,670
You...

355
00:16:46,390 --> 00:16:48,190
Even with witness testimonies,

356
00:16:48,510 --> 00:16:50,420
without physical evidence to back them up,

357
00:16:50,420 --> 00:16:52,060
they're not enough.

358
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:53,840
If you have evidence, please hand it over.

359
00:16:53,840 --> 00:16:55,080
If you don't have evidence

360
00:16:55,080 --> 00:16:56,320
and want to make a scene here,

361
00:16:56,320 --> 00:16:57,080
I'm telling you,

362
00:16:57,080 --> 00:16:58,870
our plant will absolutely not tolerate

363
00:16:58,870 --> 00:16:59,870
anyone disrupting order

364
00:16:59,870 --> 00:17:00,720
here!

365
00:17:00,750 --> 00:17:01,550
Security!

366
00:17:02,200 --> 00:17:03,260
What should you do?

367
00:17:03,670 --> 00:17:04,829
What are you waiting for?

368
00:17:04,829 --> 00:17:05,960
Kick them out! Kick them out!

369
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:06,480
How dare you!

370
00:17:06,480 --> 00:17:07,160
Don't move!

371
00:17:07,160 --> 00:17:07,920
Get out!

372
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:08,960
-Don't move!
-Get out!

373
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:09,510
Don't move!

374
00:17:09,510 --> 00:17:10,790
-Let go of me!
-Don't move!

375
00:17:10,790 --> 00:17:11,990
I have more evidence!

376
00:17:12,030 --> 00:17:12,829
Let go!

377
00:17:14,310 --> 00:17:15,790
This is my dad Chen Fu's

378
00:17:15,790 --> 00:17:17,040
work notebook.

379
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:19,160
In it,

380
00:17:20,109 --> 00:17:22,510
he kept detailed records
of his inspections

381
00:17:22,510 --> 00:17:24,710
of the pipe parts before the explosion!

382
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:26,329
If you don't believe me,

383
00:17:26,510 --> 00:17:27,400
I'll read it to you right here,

384
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:28,960
line by line!

385
00:17:29,030 --> 00:17:29,960
Shan, Shan.

386
00:17:29,960 --> 00:17:30,680
Let's... Let's...

387
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:31,940
Don't try to stop me!

388
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:33,600
You have gone too far!

389
00:17:34,270 --> 00:17:35,330
Listen carefully!

390
00:17:35,750 --> 00:17:37,830
July 17, 1997...

391
00:17:37,830 --> 00:17:39,590
-Shan! Shan!
-Shan.

392
00:17:39,590 --> 00:17:39,980
Ying!

393
00:17:40,010 --> 00:17:40,920
Shan!

394
00:17:41,310 --> 00:17:42,370
Your dad and I have worked in the plant

395
00:17:42,370 --> 00:17:43,160
our whole lives.

396
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:44,850
The plant has been good to us!

397
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:52,650
I won't allow you

398
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:56,620
to make a scene
in front of everyone in the plant!

399
00:18:01,880 --> 00:18:02,960
The plant will give us a

400
00:18:02,960 --> 00:18:03,880
fair...

401
00:18:05,110 --> 00:18:06,550
fair resolution.

402
00:18:09,070 --> 00:18:10,490
I'm making a scene?

403
00:18:11,160 --> 00:18:13,220
I'm helping Dad prove his innocence!

404
00:18:14,590 --> 00:18:15,590
Senior! Senior!

405
00:18:15,590 --> 00:18:16,350
Don't...

406
00:18:16,510 --> 00:18:17,840
Don't... don't hit him.

407
00:18:19,830 --> 00:18:20,540
Mom!

408
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:21,510
Call an ambulance!

409
00:18:21,510 --> 00:18:22,110
Call an ambulance!

410
00:18:22,110 --> 00:18:22,770
Ambulance!

411
00:18:23,350 --> 00:18:24,100
Mom!

412
00:18:24,160 --> 00:18:24,880
Go make a call!

413
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:25,680
Make a call!

414
00:18:25,710 --> 00:18:26,770
Call an ambulance!

415
00:18:43,490 --> 00:18:47,670
[Inpatient Department]

416
00:19:02,440 --> 00:19:03,240
Well...

417
00:19:05,590 --> 00:19:06,630
Ying, Shan.

418
00:19:06,650 --> 00:19:09,000
Well... the plant has agreed

419
00:19:09,030 --> 00:19:10,290
to investigate again,

420
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:14,570
and the responsibility will be determined
in 3 days.

421
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:16,310
I totally understand that you two

422
00:19:16,310 --> 00:19:17,350
want to help your dad

423
00:19:17,350 --> 00:19:18,480
prove his innocence.

424
00:19:18,480 --> 00:19:19,200
You are both

425
00:19:19,200 --> 00:19:20,310
good kids.

426
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:22,400
But for now,

427
00:19:22,590 --> 00:19:24,520
you should just stay with your mom.

428
00:19:28,310 --> 00:19:29,070
Why did my mom

429
00:19:29,070 --> 00:19:30,350
stop me today?

430
00:19:35,830 --> 00:19:37,490
Why wouldn't she let me speak?

431
00:19:38,160 --> 00:19:39,080
Shan,

432
00:19:39,640 --> 00:19:41,580
you just graduated from college.

433
00:19:42,110 --> 00:19:43,960
Adults' work

434
00:19:43,980 --> 00:19:45,570
can be very complicated.

435
00:19:46,590 --> 00:19:47,550
Especially for your mom.

436
00:19:47,550 --> 00:19:49,000
In her position,

437
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:49,640
many things

438
00:19:49,640 --> 00:19:51,550
aren't easy, and she has no choice.

439
00:19:51,550 --> 00:19:52,400
And it's not entirely

440
00:19:52,400 --> 00:19:53,790
up to your mom.

441
00:19:54,510 --> 00:19:55,510
Because things at work

442
00:19:55,510 --> 00:19:57,710
are all about weighing the pros and cons

443
00:19:57,830 --> 00:19:59,290
and being in the same boat.

444
00:20:02,830 --> 00:20:04,510
Let me tell you,

445
00:20:05,030 --> 00:20:05,830
about this matter,

446
00:20:05,830 --> 00:20:07,550
if you keep investigating it,

447
00:20:08,030 --> 00:20:08,960
it won't do you

448
00:20:08,960 --> 00:20:09,680
or your mom

449
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:10,790
any good.

450
00:20:11,750 --> 00:20:13,550
Shan, listen... listen to me.

451
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:15,000
Listen to me.

452
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:16,230
Your mom can't take it right now.

453
00:20:16,230 --> 00:20:18,230
Her body can't take any more of this.

454
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:19,550
Okay, Shan?

455
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:21,410
As for your investigation,

456
00:20:21,550 --> 00:20:22,750
put it on hold for now.

457
00:20:23,030 --> 00:20:24,110
Do it for your mom.

458
00:20:24,510 --> 00:20:25,510
Well, I...

459
00:20:39,490 --> 00:20:43,700
[Nurses' Station]

460
00:20:41,510 --> 00:20:42,070
Hello.

461
00:20:42,240 --> 00:20:43,440
Which ward is Hu Zhe in?

462
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:44,400
Let me check.

463
00:20:44,960 --> 00:20:45,750
Ying.

464
00:20:47,200 --> 00:20:48,160
I'll go with you.

465
00:20:52,070 --> 00:20:54,400
Are we really going to listen to Godfather

466
00:20:54,400 --> 00:20:55,750
and just let this go?

467
00:20:57,270 --> 00:20:58,640
I get...

468
00:20:59,440 --> 00:21:00,640
what he said,

469
00:21:00,880 --> 00:21:01,880
and I understand.

470
00:21:03,030 --> 00:21:04,790
In a place like the transmission plant,

471
00:21:04,790 --> 00:21:06,400
it's all about fitting in

472
00:21:06,400 --> 00:21:07,860
and sharing the benefits.

473
00:21:08,310 --> 00:21:10,370
Everyone should support each other.

474
00:21:11,440 --> 00:21:12,440
Some things

475
00:21:13,160 --> 00:21:14,760
aren't just black and white.

476
00:21:18,510 --> 00:21:19,770
Does that include Mom?

477
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:28,750
Shan.

478
00:21:30,480 --> 00:21:31,750
Mom might be a bit too involved

479
00:21:31,750 --> 00:21:33,200
in social niceties,

480
00:21:34,350 --> 00:21:35,350
but on major issues

481
00:21:35,350 --> 00:21:37,080
of right and wrong, I trust her.

482
00:21:38,030 --> 00:21:39,490
She has her own standards.

483
00:21:39,920 --> 00:21:41,380
Even if we assume the worst

484
00:21:41,790 --> 00:21:43,240
and she actually knew something,

485
00:21:43,240 --> 00:21:44,750
she wouldn't get involved.

486
00:21:44,750 --> 00:21:45,830
She knows what she should

487
00:21:45,830 --> 00:21:47,070
and shouldn't do.

488
00:21:56,400 --> 00:21:57,370
Godfather said

489
00:21:57,750 --> 00:21:59,280
Wan Yang is planning to hold

490
00:21:59,440 --> 00:22:00,750
a meeting in 3 days to determine

491
00:22:00,750 --> 00:22:02,280
the cause of the explosion.

492
00:22:02,310 --> 00:22:02,920
When the time comes,

493
00:22:02,920 --> 00:22:04,790
if they're willing to clear Dad's name,

494
00:22:04,790 --> 00:22:05,790
we'll let it go.

495
00:22:06,480 --> 00:22:07,480
If they

496
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:09,800
dare to distort the truth again,

497
00:22:09,960 --> 00:22:11,820
I'll fight them to the bitter end.

498
00:22:11,830 --> 00:22:13,690
Let's wait for the results first.

499
00:22:23,160 --> 00:22:26,700
[Three Days Later]

500
00:22:30,030 --> 00:22:30,830
Senior.

501
00:22:31,270 --> 00:22:32,070
Senior.

502
00:22:32,640 --> 00:22:34,350
You're not feeling well.

503
00:22:34,350 --> 00:22:35,750
You shouldn't have come.

504
00:22:35,750 --> 00:22:36,480
It's fine.

505
00:22:37,240 --> 00:22:38,170
I should be here.

506
00:22:39,240 --> 00:22:40,070
Okay, okay.

507
00:22:40,160 --> 00:22:41,030
Ying, Ying.

508
00:22:41,200 --> 00:22:42,640
Remember what I told you

509
00:22:42,640 --> 00:22:43,550
at the hospital.

510
00:22:43,550 --> 00:22:44,680
Know your limits.

511
00:22:44,920 --> 00:22:46,310
Hold... Hold Shan back a bit.

512
00:22:46,310 --> 00:22:47,640
Don't worry, Godfather.

513
00:22:47,640 --> 00:22:49,040
Shan, it's fine. Go on in.

514
00:22:49,480 --> 00:22:50,030
Go in.

515
00:23:06,680 --> 00:23:08,180
After gathering data,

516
00:23:08,480 --> 00:23:11,200
conducting an investigation,
and repeatedly verifying the facts,

517
00:23:11,200 --> 00:23:12,200
I hereby announce

518
00:23:12,550 --> 00:23:14,310
that the pipeline explosion

519
00:23:14,400 --> 00:23:16,330
in the Wuxin section of Project 713

520
00:23:16,480 --> 00:23:18,070
had nothing to do with

521
00:23:18,920 --> 00:23:21,090
the construction team's operations

522
00:23:21,680 --> 00:23:22,830
or the late Captain Chen Fu.

523
00:23:22,830 --> 00:23:24,090
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

524
00:23:26,980 --> 00:23:27,890
Mom.

525
00:23:31,830 --> 00:23:33,160
Ms. Zhang Wenying's design

526
00:23:33,160 --> 00:23:35,400
for this section of Project 713

527
00:23:35,920 --> 00:23:37,510
routed the pipeline
through geologically complex strata

528
00:23:37,510 --> 00:23:39,310
without proper consideration,

529
00:23:39,440 --> 00:23:41,400
then abruptly routed it
into the river channel.

530
00:23:41,400 --> 00:23:42,550
This caused the temperature

531
00:23:42,550 --> 00:23:43,420
of the natural gas inside the pipeline

532
00:23:43,420 --> 00:23:45,160
to fluctuate by over 3 degrees
within a short period

533
00:23:45,160 --> 00:23:46,480
and created

534
00:23:46,570 --> 00:23:48,030
pressure differences sufficient

535
00:23:48,030 --> 00:23:49,310
to trigger changes in the gas.

536
00:23:49,310 --> 00:23:50,970
According to the blueprints,

537
00:23:51,030 --> 00:23:53,090
excessive amounts of solid sulfides

538
00:23:53,880 --> 00:23:55,740
had accumulated on the pipe walls

539
00:23:56,270 --> 00:23:58,960
at the downstream end
of the middle section

540
00:23:59,070 --> 00:24:00,620
of the filter separators,

541
00:24:00,750 --> 00:24:02,150
posing an explosion risk

542
00:24:02,160 --> 00:24:04,070
during construction.

543
00:24:04,920 --> 00:24:05,720
The design department

544
00:24:05,720 --> 00:24:07,050
led by Ms. Zhang Wenying

545
00:24:07,960 --> 00:24:09,820
shall bear full responsibility.

546
00:24:10,250 --> 00:24:13,270
They are to be handed over to
the Project 713 Accident Investigation Team

547
00:24:13,270 --> 00:24:15,200
to assist with the investigation.

548
00:24:15,400 --> 00:24:16,530
Meeting adjourned.

549
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:18,000
Director Wan.

550
00:24:18,400 --> 00:24:20,750
We don't accept this conclusion.

551
00:24:20,830 --> 00:24:23,030
We... We demand that technical experts

552
00:24:23,160 --> 00:24:24,550
reassess these

553
00:24:24,550 --> 00:24:25,550
design blueprints!

554
00:24:25,550 --> 00:24:26,310
Right!

555
00:24:26,400 --> 00:24:27,960
Well, how is this possible?

556
00:24:29,350 --> 00:24:30,790
Reassess?

557
00:24:31,110 --> 00:24:32,030
Can you do it?

558
00:24:32,310 --> 00:24:33,070
I can.

559
00:24:33,330 --> 00:24:34,390
[Project 713 Pipeline Explosion]

560
00:24:34,420 --> 00:24:36,280
[Investigation and Accountability Meeting]

561
00:25:10,750 --> 00:25:11,550
Director Wan,

562
00:25:12,880 --> 00:25:14,410
this is indeed a design plan

563
00:25:14,510 --> 00:25:15,550
we worked on

564
00:25:15,550 --> 00:25:17,110
in the early stages.

565
00:25:17,830 --> 00:25:19,510
But the pipeline route

566
00:25:19,510 --> 00:25:20,440
in the final plan

567
00:25:21,960 --> 00:25:23,140
is different.

568
00:25:33,160 --> 00:25:34,680
I'm the director
of the archives department.

569
00:25:34,680 --> 00:25:35,680
What he said is impossible.

570
00:25:35,680 --> 00:25:37,070
This is the final version.

571
00:25:37,070 --> 00:25:38,130
I personally watched it

572
00:25:38,130 --> 00:25:39,000
being sealed into the file bag.

573
00:25:39,000 --> 00:25:39,960
How is that possible?

574
00:25:39,960 --> 00:25:41,070
Look at it.

575
00:25:41,160 --> 00:25:42,240
This pipeline route

576
00:25:42,240 --> 00:25:43,550
is not the one in our final plan.

577
00:25:43,550 --> 00:25:44,640
So you mean

578
00:25:44,720 --> 00:25:47,120
I'm deliberately framing Director Zhang?

579
00:25:58,480 --> 00:25:59,590
We can ask our colleagues
in the design department...

580
00:25:59,590 --> 00:26:00,590
It is...

581
00:26:00,590 --> 00:26:01,590
Stop arguing.

582
00:26:02,070 --> 00:26:04,000
Director Zhang happens to be here.

583
00:26:04,160 --> 00:26:05,510
Let her speak.

584
00:26:18,550 --> 00:26:20,010
This is the final version.

585
00:26:26,480 --> 00:26:29,160
I will resign as director
of the design department

586
00:26:29,160 --> 00:26:32,030
and take full responsibility
for the explosion

587
00:26:32,030 --> 00:26:33,310
in the Wuxin section of Project 713.

588
00:26:33,310 --> 00:26:34,070
Mom!

589
00:26:35,480 --> 00:26:36,310
Master, this...

590
00:26:36,310 --> 00:26:38,160
-Qi.
-It's not the final version!

591
00:26:38,160 --> 00:26:39,110
-We...
-Qi.

592
00:26:39,750 --> 00:26:40,830
Say no more.

593
00:26:41,160 --> 00:26:42,440
I am the project leader.

594
00:26:42,440 --> 00:26:43,790
My signature is on it.

595
00:26:43,790 --> 00:26:45,250
You have no right to speak.

596
00:27:06,160 --> 00:27:07,440
I'm downstairs.

597
00:27:15,440 --> 00:27:16,640
As for the explosion,

598
00:27:18,070 --> 00:27:20,270
we'd already agreed on how to handle it.

599
00:27:20,270 --> 00:27:21,350
But those two kids

600
00:27:21,350 --> 00:27:22,950
brought it out into the open.

601
00:27:23,750 --> 00:27:24,590
Now,

602
00:27:25,200 --> 00:27:28,130
we can no longer use
Chen Fu's improper construction

603
00:27:28,590 --> 00:27:29,550
as an excuse.

604
00:27:30,240 --> 00:27:31,030
Director,

605
00:27:31,830 --> 00:27:33,630
I didn't know they would do that.

606
00:27:35,750 --> 00:27:37,030
Standing up for parents

607
00:27:37,030 --> 00:27:38,350
is human nature.

608
00:27:38,920 --> 00:27:40,360
But you should understand

609
00:27:40,360 --> 00:27:41,630
the stakes involved.

610
00:27:42,070 --> 00:27:43,670
If they keep investigating,

611
00:27:43,680 --> 00:27:45,540
both you and I will be implicated.

612
00:27:46,720 --> 00:27:48,310
The best way

613
00:27:49,830 --> 00:27:51,430
to handle this explosion now

614
00:27:52,310 --> 00:27:54,400
is for someone to take the blame.

615
00:27:55,680 --> 00:27:57,160
If the dead can't take it,

616
00:27:57,640 --> 00:27:59,400
then the living must.

617
00:28:00,030 --> 00:28:01,670
You mean me?

618
00:28:02,160 --> 00:28:04,310
If you're willing
to take the blame for this,

619
00:28:04,310 --> 00:28:06,400
at most
you'll be suspended and transferred.

620
00:28:06,400 --> 00:28:07,880
You'll be sent to the city first

621
00:28:07,880 --> 00:28:09,400
for review by the investigation team.

622
00:28:09,400 --> 00:28:10,550
I'll try to get you

623
00:28:11,110 --> 00:28:12,570
disciplined internally.

624
00:28:14,160 --> 00:28:15,200
No, Director Wan.

625
00:28:15,400 --> 00:28:17,730
We're pushing through reforms this year.

626
00:28:17,920 --> 00:28:18,880
If I take this responsibility,

627
00:28:18,880 --> 00:28:20,110
I will be affected.

628
00:28:20,110 --> 00:28:21,240
I don't care about myself,

629
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:23,160
but I have two children to think about.

630
00:28:23,160 --> 00:28:24,190
Zhang Wenying.

631
00:28:26,480 --> 00:28:27,110
Don't you think

632
00:28:27,110 --> 00:28:28,880
it's time to repay the debt

633
00:28:28,880 --> 00:28:30,150
you owe

634
00:28:31,720 --> 00:28:33,580
Chen Ying's biological parents?

635
00:28:48,290 --> 00:28:49,400
[Wugang Petrochemical Plant]

636
00:28:49,350 --> 00:28:49,960
Mom!

637
00:28:49,960 --> 00:28:50,640
Don't come any closer!

638
00:28:50,640 --> 00:28:51,110
Mom!

639
00:28:51,110 --> 00:28:52,680
Go back to work! Go back to work!

640
00:28:52,680 --> 00:28:53,510
Stop gawking!

641
00:28:53,510 --> 00:28:54,110
Mom!

642
00:28:54,590 --> 00:28:55,440
Stop gawking!

643
00:28:55,480 --> 00:28:56,000
Mom!

644
00:28:56,000 --> 00:28:57,110
Let go of my mom!

645
00:28:57,110 --> 00:28:58,030
Don't touch my mom!

646
00:28:58,030 --> 00:28:59,740
-You can't take my mom away!
-Don't touch my mom!

647
00:28:59,740 --> 00:29:00,220
Move!

648
00:29:00,960 --> 00:29:02,640
-Mom! Mom!
-Mom!

649
00:29:02,660 --> 00:29:03,980
-Mom!
-Say something!

650
00:29:04,510 --> 00:29:05,380
Stop the car!

651
00:29:06,030 --> 00:29:06,590
Mom!

652
00:29:07,790 --> 00:29:09,000
Don't take my mom away!

653
00:29:09,000 --> 00:29:09,700
Mom!

654
00:29:09,720 --> 00:29:11,130
Don't take my mom away!

655
00:29:11,930 --> 00:29:12,600
Mom!

656
00:29:13,480 --> 00:29:14,240
Stop the car!

657
00:29:44,550 --> 00:29:45,160
Ying.

658
00:29:46,270 --> 00:29:46,870
I want to know

659
00:29:46,870 --> 00:29:47,920
why Mom admitted to

660
00:29:47,920 --> 00:29:49,320
the things she didn't do.

661
00:29:53,110 --> 00:29:54,310
Is there some secret

662
00:29:55,750 --> 00:29:56,720
between

663
00:29:56,720 --> 00:29:58,070
her and Wan Yang?

664
00:30:01,790 --> 00:30:02,590
Shan.

665
00:30:04,930 --> 00:30:06,860
What exactly are you trying to say?

666
00:30:08,550 --> 00:30:09,650
When Dad came back that day,

667
00:30:09,650 --> 00:30:11,550
he obviously noticed something was wrong.

668
00:30:11,550 --> 00:30:13,510
He must have told Mom when he got home.

669
00:30:13,510 --> 00:30:15,590
Mom was on edge all night.

670
00:30:17,960 --> 00:30:18,660
I don't know

671
00:30:18,690 --> 00:30:20,270
if Wan Yang is threatening Mom

672
00:30:20,270 --> 00:30:21,880
or if Mom is deliberately...

673
00:30:22,030 --> 00:30:22,790
hiding something for him.

674
00:30:22,790 --> 00:30:23,270
Why won't she

675
00:30:23,270 --> 00:30:24,480
tell us anything?

676
00:30:24,480 --> 00:30:25,810
Have you lost your mind?

677
00:30:26,160 --> 00:30:28,400
You've been acting strange
since yesterday.

678
00:30:28,400 --> 00:30:28,920
What on earth

679
00:30:28,920 --> 00:30:29,920
are you thinking?

680
00:30:29,920 --> 00:30:31,380
How could you suspect Mom?

681
00:30:38,830 --> 00:30:40,080
[Design Department]

682
00:30:41,750 --> 00:30:43,010
Deputy Director Feng.

683
00:30:43,790 --> 00:30:44,590
Busy?

684
00:30:44,920 --> 00:30:45,810
We've got orders from above.

685
00:30:45,810 --> 00:30:46,830
Zhang Wenying's office

686
00:30:46,830 --> 00:30:48,110
needs to be sealed off.

687
00:30:48,790 --> 00:30:50,110
Do it!

688
00:30:50,110 --> 00:30:50,830
Don't!

689
00:30:51,640 --> 00:30:52,350
Wait a moment.

690
00:30:52,350 --> 00:30:54,000
I have things there.

691
00:30:54,000 --> 00:30:54,790
Your things?

692
00:30:54,790 --> 00:30:55,350
Come on.

693
00:30:55,350 --> 00:30:56,750
Go fetch them.

694
00:30:57,790 --> 00:30:59,000
Don't go inside.

695
00:30:59,160 --> 00:31:00,160
What does it have to do with you?

696
00:31:00,160 --> 00:31:02,160
-No, they don't know...
-Hurry up! Hurry up!

697
00:31:02,160 --> 00:31:03,310
My box...

698
00:31:03,350 --> 00:31:04,160
We'll get everything out for you.

699
00:31:04,160 --> 00:31:04,880
We'll get everything out for you.

700
00:31:04,880 --> 00:31:05,940
Here, here.

701
00:31:06,160 --> 00:31:06,960
But... I...

702
00:31:06,960 --> 00:31:07,880
-Okay.
-Here.

703
00:31:08,880 --> 00:31:09,910
Seal it.

704
00:31:09,960 --> 00:31:11,000
Don't! Wait a moment!

705
00:31:11,000 --> 00:31:11,510
What are you doing?

706
00:31:11,510 --> 00:31:12,070
What are you doing?

707
00:31:12,070 --> 00:31:13,680
Wait! That box...

708
00:31:13,680 --> 00:31:14,750
You took my box out.

709
00:31:14,750 --> 00:31:16,000
But I haven't taken my washbasin out yet.

710
00:31:16,000 --> 00:31:16,960
Here. See?

711
00:31:17,110 --> 00:31:17,850
This is my...

712
00:31:18,240 --> 00:31:18,740
Hurry!

713
00:31:18,760 --> 00:31:19,580
Hurry!

714
00:31:19,960 --> 00:31:21,030
What are you doing?

715
00:31:21,030 --> 00:31:21,550
No, this is mine.

716
00:31:21,550 --> 00:31:22,440
Can you take this?

717
00:31:22,440 --> 00:31:23,310
This is public property.

718
00:31:23,310 --> 00:31:24,110
No, this is my personal...

719
00:31:24,110 --> 00:31:24,510
Go. Go.

720
00:31:24,520 --> 00:31:25,160
Leave.

721
00:31:25,280 --> 00:31:26,920
-That's my personal...
-That's enough.

722
00:31:26,920 --> 00:31:27,640
Your personal property?

723
00:31:27,640 --> 00:31:29,030
Seal it!

724
00:31:31,270 --> 00:31:31,960
Well...

725
00:31:34,750 --> 00:31:35,480
Mr. Qi.

726
00:31:36,350 --> 00:31:38,000
You've been here for ten years,

727
00:31:38,000 --> 00:31:39,930
and you don't even have a dorm room?

728
00:31:40,550 --> 00:31:41,540
Ridiculous.

729
00:31:41,720 --> 00:31:43,850
We're leaving, Deputy Director Feng.

730
00:31:50,240 --> 00:31:52,030
He used to have Master to protect him.

731
00:31:52,030 --> 00:31:53,510
Now he's completely done for.

732
00:31:53,510 --> 00:31:54,880
Let's see if he can still act tough.

733
00:31:54,880 --> 00:31:55,960
Stop talking.

734
00:31:56,920 --> 00:31:57,880
Ying, Shan.

735
00:31:58,680 --> 00:31:59,350
Godfather?

736
00:31:59,350 --> 00:32:00,350
You're home, huh?

737
00:32:00,480 --> 00:32:01,590
Where is Shan?

738
00:32:02,680 --> 00:32:03,310
Godfather.

739
00:32:03,310 --> 00:32:04,920
I was just packing some things

740
00:32:04,920 --> 00:32:06,240
to bring to my mom.

741
00:32:06,260 --> 00:32:07,310
Don't go. Don't go.

742
00:32:07,310 --> 00:32:08,070
I prepared some things

743
00:32:08,070 --> 00:32:09,640
and was about to go,

744
00:32:09,750 --> 00:32:11,310
but they stopped me.

745
00:32:11,510 --> 00:32:12,310
They said visits are not allowed

746
00:32:12,310 --> 00:32:13,640
during this time.

747
00:32:14,200 --> 00:32:15,010
Come on. Come on.

748
00:32:15,010 --> 00:32:15,910
I bought you some food.

749
00:32:15,910 --> 00:32:16,750
Eat up.

750
00:32:17,680 --> 00:32:18,750
Come here, Shan. Come.

751
00:32:18,750 --> 00:32:20,350
I'm not hungry. You guys eat.

752
00:32:21,550 --> 00:32:22,750
Don't get too pissed.

753
00:32:22,750 --> 00:32:24,110
You still need to eat.

754
00:32:25,880 --> 00:32:26,680
Godfather.

755
00:32:29,160 --> 00:32:30,750
We want to get my mom out.

756
00:32:31,750 --> 00:32:32,550
Now...

757
00:32:33,750 --> 00:32:35,310
they won't even let us see her.

758
00:32:35,310 --> 00:32:36,720
We don't know what to do.

759
00:32:42,240 --> 00:32:43,920
This guy is really, really awful,

760
00:32:43,920 --> 00:32:44,640
you know?

761
00:32:45,310 --> 00:32:46,480
Your father is dead,

762
00:32:46,480 --> 00:32:46,920
and now

763
00:32:46,920 --> 00:32:48,720
he won't even let your mother go.

764
00:32:51,070 --> 00:32:52,160
It was actually Wan Yang.

765
00:32:52,160 --> 00:32:52,750
The explosion

766
00:32:52,750 --> 00:32:54,070
was definitely related

767
00:32:54,070 --> 00:32:54,750
to him.

768
00:32:54,750 --> 00:32:55,550
I'm sure of it.

769
00:32:55,550 --> 00:32:56,720
Just go to Wan Yang.

770
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:57,310
Because I really

771
00:32:57,310 --> 00:32:58,640
know this guy too well.

772
00:32:58,830 --> 00:32:59,590
He is capable...

773
00:32:59,590 --> 00:33:00,790
of doing anything.

774
00:33:00,790 --> 00:33:02,160
He used to be in the Northwest.

775
00:33:02,160 --> 00:33:03,160
He's been back at this plant

776
00:33:03,160 --> 00:33:03,880
for just a short time—

777
00:33:03,880 --> 00:33:04,880
over ten years.

778
00:33:04,880 --> 00:33:06,110
Look at what he's turned it into!

779
00:33:06,110 --> 00:33:07,200
It's a mess now!

780
00:33:10,110 --> 00:33:12,170
Thanks for your hard work, everyone.

781
00:33:12,710 --> 00:33:14,510
Director, what brings you here?

782
00:33:14,550 --> 00:33:15,830
If you need anything, just let me know.

783
00:33:15,830 --> 00:33:17,200
I can go to you.

784
00:33:18,880 --> 00:33:19,940
Just taking a look.

785
00:33:22,000 --> 00:33:22,790
Everyone.

786
00:33:23,310 --> 00:33:24,640
I've always emphasized

787
00:33:24,880 --> 00:33:26,400
that the design department

788
00:33:26,400 --> 00:33:27,920
is the heart of our plant.

789
00:33:28,640 --> 00:33:29,440
But now

790
00:33:30,720 --> 00:33:32,120
is not the time for grief.

791
00:33:32,430 --> 00:33:34,160
We must turn our grief into strength,

792
00:33:34,160 --> 00:33:35,620
hurry up with the repairs,

793
00:33:35,680 --> 00:33:37,070
redraw the blueprints,

794
00:33:37,070 --> 00:33:38,550
correct the mistakes,

795
00:33:38,750 --> 00:33:41,310
and rebuild the damaged site.

796
00:33:41,830 --> 00:33:42,510
Okay.

797
00:33:42,830 --> 00:33:43,780
Director Feng.

798
00:33:44,480 --> 00:33:46,160
Although you are the acting director,

799
00:33:46,160 --> 00:33:48,200
you have a heavy burden on your shoulders.

800
00:33:48,200 --> 00:33:49,440
You have to stay strong.

801
00:33:49,440 --> 00:33:50,240
Rest assured.

802
00:33:50,240 --> 00:33:51,060
I guarantee

803
00:33:51,090 --> 00:33:52,480
we'll complete the repairs
to a high standard

804
00:33:52,480 --> 00:33:53,350
within 2 months.

805
00:33:53,350 --> 00:33:54,160
One month.

806
00:33:55,160 --> 00:33:56,420
If you let me handle it,

807
00:33:56,550 --> 00:33:57,550
I guarantee

808
00:33:57,760 --> 00:33:59,160
we'll get the job done in one month

809
00:33:59,160 --> 00:34:00,820
for two-thirds of the budget.

810
00:34:01,440 --> 00:34:02,240
Mr. Qi,

811
00:34:02,440 --> 00:34:03,750
are you kidding?

812
00:34:03,790 --> 00:34:06,190
You have to be responsible
for what you say.

813
00:34:06,750 --> 00:34:07,680
This project

814
00:34:07,960 --> 00:34:09,150
was handled by my master,

815
00:34:09,150 --> 00:34:10,360
Zhang Wenying, and me

816
00:34:10,360 --> 00:34:11,620
from beginning to end.

817
00:34:11,800 --> 00:34:13,090
No one knows this project

818
00:34:13,090 --> 00:34:14,020
better than I do.

819
00:34:15,230 --> 00:34:16,150
I'm willing

820
00:34:16,630 --> 00:34:17,960
to stake my career on it.

821
00:34:18,150 --> 00:34:19,610
If I can't get the job done,

822
00:34:19,670 --> 00:34:21,000
I'll resign on the spot.

823
00:34:22,710 --> 00:34:23,510
Alright.

824
00:34:23,760 --> 00:34:24,840
Since Mr. Qi

825
00:34:25,360 --> 00:34:27,320
has volunteered
and is willing to take responsibility,

826
00:34:27,320 --> 00:34:28,320
I hereby announce

827
00:34:28,630 --> 00:34:29,500
the immediate formation

828
00:34:29,500 --> 00:34:32,070
of the Project 713
Emergency Repair Design Team.

829
00:34:32,070 --> 00:34:33,070
Mr. Qi Mo

830
00:34:33,670 --> 00:34:34,800
will be the team leader.

831
00:34:34,800 --> 00:34:36,800
Everyone else in the design department

832
00:34:36,800 --> 00:34:38,230
will be at his disposal

833
00:34:38,139 --> 00:34:41,440
[Sealed]

834
00:34:38,280 --> 00:34:39,920
and give him their full support.

835
00:34:39,920 --> 00:34:40,730
Are you determined

836
00:34:40,730 --> 00:34:41,659
to get this done?

837
00:34:43,440 --> 00:34:44,230
Yes.

838
00:34:44,760 --> 00:34:45,960
We won't let you down.

839
00:34:48,550 --> 00:34:49,960
Remember your pledge.

840
00:34:50,550 --> 00:34:51,920
If you fail to complete the task,

841
00:34:51,920 --> 00:34:53,320
I won't be able to protect you either.

842
00:34:53,320 --> 00:34:54,719
Rest assured, Director.

843
00:34:54,760 --> 00:34:56,420
I'll be waiting for good news.

844
00:34:57,780 --> 00:35:01,100
[Sealed]

845
00:35:06,880 --> 00:35:07,880
Mom told me

846
00:35:08,230 --> 00:35:09,070
the former director

847
00:35:09,070 --> 00:35:10,710
originally wanted you to succeed him,

848
00:35:10,710 --> 00:35:12,320
but Wan Yang ruined it.

849
00:35:12,320 --> 00:35:13,070
Is that true?

850
00:35:14,880 --> 00:35:16,320
Being the director...

851
00:35:16,550 --> 00:35:17,630
Whether it's director or deputy director,

852
00:35:17,630 --> 00:35:18,150
it means

853
00:35:18,170 --> 00:35:19,150
nothing to me.

854
00:35:20,230 --> 00:35:22,030
But it's different for Wan Yang.

855
00:35:22,030 --> 00:35:22,800
Since he became director,

856
00:35:22,800 --> 00:35:24,150
he has been doing

857
00:35:24,150 --> 00:35:25,000
all sorts of things

858
00:35:25,000 --> 00:35:26,550
to line his pockets at every turn.

859
00:35:26,550 --> 00:35:27,320
He'd stop at nothing

860
00:35:27,320 --> 00:35:28,710
to make money.

861
00:35:29,110 --> 00:35:29,840
He doesn't care whether

862
00:35:29,840 --> 00:35:30,760
any part...

863
00:35:30,760 --> 00:35:31,590
any part of a project

864
00:35:31,590 --> 00:35:32,550
meets...

865
00:35:32,800 --> 00:35:33,760
like...

866
00:35:33,760 --> 00:35:35,110
safety requirements.

867
00:35:35,110 --> 00:35:36,710
He never considers the risks.

868
00:35:36,710 --> 00:35:37,760
In engineering,

869
00:35:37,760 --> 00:35:39,110
there are no small matters.

870
00:35:39,110 --> 00:35:40,000
Every part,

871
00:35:40,000 --> 00:35:40,960
from the pipelines

872
00:35:40,960 --> 00:35:42,550
to the welds and flanges,

873
00:35:42,550 --> 00:35:43,960
has to meet

874
00:35:43,960 --> 00:35:45,510
safety standards.

875
00:35:45,510 --> 00:35:46,150
Otherwise,

876
00:35:46,150 --> 00:35:48,080
an explosion could easily happen.

877
00:35:49,240 --> 00:35:50,620
So that's why Dad

878
00:35:51,110 --> 00:35:52,360
reacted that way when he saw the flange

879
00:35:52,360 --> 00:35:53,480
that day.

880
00:35:55,230 --> 00:35:56,110
I get it now.

881
00:35:57,550 --> 00:35:58,080
But that

882
00:35:58,100 --> 00:35:59,830
flange with the wrong material

883
00:35:59,920 --> 00:36:00,920
could be evidence

884
00:36:00,920 --> 00:36:02,710
that Wan Yang bought substandard materials

885
00:36:02,710 --> 00:36:04,070
at inflated prices?

886
00:36:04,070 --> 00:36:04,840
Of course.

887
00:36:05,480 --> 00:36:06,280
Godfather.

888
00:36:06,710 --> 00:36:07,510
Embezzle—

889
00:36:08,190 --> 00:36:10,120
If there really was embezzlement,

890
00:36:10,440 --> 00:36:11,320
the...

891
00:36:12,440 --> 00:36:14,110
the procurement department

892
00:36:14,110 --> 00:36:14,760
would have to be involved.

893
00:36:14,760 --> 00:36:15,760
Sun Jie is in charge of purchasing

894
00:36:15,760 --> 00:36:16,320
at our plant,

895
00:36:16,320 --> 00:36:17,190
and everyone knows

896
00:36:17,190 --> 00:36:18,920
he's one of the director's men.

897
00:36:19,510 --> 00:36:20,360
Could we start...

898
00:36:20,360 --> 00:36:22,510
by investigating him?

899
00:36:23,360 --> 00:36:24,110
Ying, aren't you

900
00:36:24,110 --> 00:36:25,440
about to start work?

901
00:36:25,440 --> 00:36:26,110
Once you start work,

902
00:36:26,110 --> 00:36:27,150
keep your eyes open

903
00:36:27,150 --> 00:36:28,280
in the supply department.

904
00:36:28,280 --> 00:36:30,070
You'll definitely spot some clues.

905
00:36:30,070 --> 00:36:31,200
You know what I mean?

906
00:36:34,920 --> 00:36:36,000
Also, there's that guy...

907
00:36:36,000 --> 00:36:36,760
That Sun Jie

908
00:36:36,760 --> 00:36:38,360
has a subordinate, called...

909
00:36:38,360 --> 00:36:39,320
The head of the transport team,

910
00:36:39,320 --> 00:36:40,070
Liu Jun.

911
00:36:41,400 --> 00:36:43,000
He's Wan Yang's brother-in-law.

912
00:36:43,000 --> 00:36:43,800
He's...

913
00:36:43,800 --> 00:36:45,050
always there.

914
00:36:45,080 --> 00:36:46,110
He's in the plant

915
00:36:46,110 --> 00:36:46,550
all the time.

916
00:36:46,550 --> 00:36:47,360
And he...

917
00:36:47,360 --> 00:36:48,560
He's not very bright.

918
00:36:48,590 --> 00:36:49,400
We can...

919
00:36:49,550 --> 00:36:51,070
We can start with him.

920
00:36:53,280 --> 00:36:55,760
Liu Jun works in transportation.

921
00:36:56,550 --> 00:36:59,410
The construction site
is under tight security now.

922
00:36:59,550 --> 00:37:00,900
My sister and I almost got caught

923
00:37:00,900 --> 00:37:02,070
when we went there last time.

924
00:37:02,070 --> 00:37:03,110
They're bound

925
00:37:03,440 --> 00:37:04,970
to be even more careful now.

926
00:37:06,400 --> 00:37:07,150
Leave it to me.

927
00:37:07,150 --> 00:37:08,230
I'll go find them.

928
00:37:08,440 --> 00:37:09,670
I'll go talk to the construction team

929
00:37:09,670 --> 00:37:10,930
and get you a job there.

930
00:37:11,070 --> 00:37:12,000
That way, you'll be able to

931
00:37:12,000 --> 00:37:13,150
come and go more easily.

932
00:37:13,150 --> 00:37:14,010
I'll handle it.

933
00:37:14,760 --> 00:37:16,290
Will that work, Godfather?

934
00:37:16,590 --> 00:37:17,550
I've been the deputy director

935
00:37:17,550 --> 00:37:18,550
for so many years.

936
00:37:18,550 --> 00:37:19,550
I still have

937
00:37:19,550 --> 00:37:20,480
some influence.

938
00:37:22,070 --> 00:37:23,190
Leave this to me.

939
00:37:24,000 --> 00:37:25,110
Come on. Eat up.

940
00:37:25,110 --> 00:37:26,240
Hurry. Eat up. Here.

941
00:37:33,760 --> 00:37:34,480
Come in.

942
00:37:36,880 --> 00:37:37,670
Sir.

943
00:37:38,110 --> 00:37:40,170
Here are the materials you asked for.

944
00:37:43,480 --> 00:37:45,740
If you have any grievances, just tell me.

945
00:37:45,880 --> 00:37:46,920
Don't hold it in.

946
00:37:49,110 --> 00:37:51,070
You must have a better plan, sir.

947
00:37:51,440 --> 00:37:53,590
I will execute it unconditionally.

948
00:37:56,110 --> 00:37:57,760
I haven't forgotten

949
00:37:57,920 --> 00:37:58,780
our agreement.

950
00:37:58,960 --> 00:38:00,670
You'll lead

951
00:38:01,590 --> 00:38:03,070
the Project 713 restoration.

952
00:38:03,070 --> 00:38:04,590
You'll be using
Zhang Wenying's blueprints.

953
00:38:04,590 --> 00:38:06,480
Once we replace the flanges,

954
00:38:07,110 --> 00:38:10,000
you'll officially become director
of the design department.

955
00:38:10,000 --> 00:38:11,110
You and I both know

956
00:38:11,550 --> 00:38:12,840
Qi Mo

957
00:38:14,230 --> 00:38:15,320
is a major problem.

958
00:38:16,190 --> 00:38:18,110
I hadn't even figured out
how to deal with him,

959
00:38:18,110 --> 00:38:18,920
and he was already

960
00:38:18,920 --> 00:38:20,320
making a move.

961
00:38:21,360 --> 00:38:22,660
Zhang Wenying told me

962
00:38:22,840 --> 00:38:25,190
about the project details before.

963
00:38:26,360 --> 00:38:27,160
There's no way

964
00:38:28,070 --> 00:38:29,920
he can finish it in a month.

965
00:38:31,480 --> 00:38:32,750
So you're saying

966
00:38:32,920 --> 00:38:34,360
we'll corner him when the time comes

967
00:38:34,360 --> 00:38:35,110
and get rid of him

968
00:38:35,110 --> 00:38:36,320
for good, right?

969
00:38:36,480 --> 00:38:38,740
If he can't finish the job, he'll resign.

970
00:38:39,630 --> 00:38:41,030
Those were his own words.

971
00:38:42,320 --> 00:38:44,450
Let's just sit back and watch the show.

972
00:38:45,440 --> 00:38:46,590
You're brilliant.

973
00:38:49,920 --> 00:38:51,440
I just can't get it right.

974
00:38:51,550 --> 00:38:53,280
It looks so good.

975
00:38:53,510 --> 00:38:54,110
Really?

976
00:38:54,110 --> 00:38:54,840
Yes.

977
00:38:55,480 --> 00:38:56,550
Then it's yours.

978
00:38:57,070 --> 00:38:58,360
I'm so honored.

979
00:39:02,840 --> 00:39:04,840
I can't embarrass myself like that.

980
00:39:08,510 --> 00:39:10,110
Here, try the noodles I made.

981
00:39:15,920 --> 00:39:16,520
Director.

982
00:39:17,150 --> 00:39:17,630
Okay.

983
00:39:21,760 --> 00:39:22,440
Captain He.

984
00:39:25,920 --> 00:39:27,180
Deputy Director Geng?

985
00:39:27,670 --> 00:39:28,710
What brings you

986
00:39:28,760 --> 00:39:30,110
to our construction team today?

987
00:39:30,110 --> 00:39:32,170
Nothing. I'm just here to take a look.

988
00:39:32,750 --> 00:39:33,690
Keep eating.

989
00:39:35,360 --> 00:39:36,800
I'm in a hurry to get to the site.

990
00:39:36,800 --> 00:39:37,800
I'll keep eating.

991
00:39:38,230 --> 00:39:39,880
What can I do for you?

992
00:39:43,840 --> 00:39:44,630
Captain He,

993
00:39:45,920 --> 00:39:47,130
you should know

994
00:39:47,440 --> 00:39:48,960
that before Captain Chen's accident,

995
00:39:48,960 --> 00:39:50,280
he'd already arranged
for his son, Chen Shan,

996
00:39:50,280 --> 00:39:52,510
to join the construction team.

997
00:39:52,510 --> 00:39:53,230
Well,

998
00:39:53,230 --> 00:39:53,760
things are

999
00:39:53,760 --> 00:39:55,110
mostly settled now.

1000
00:39:55,230 --> 00:39:56,960
Captain He, please do me a favor

1001
00:39:57,070 --> 00:39:57,920
and guide him.

1002
00:40:02,000 --> 00:40:03,920
It's not that
I don't want to do you this favor.

1003
00:40:03,920 --> 00:40:05,960
Other things are negotiable,

1004
00:40:06,150 --> 00:40:07,550
but this Chen Shan

1005
00:40:08,960 --> 00:40:10,880
really can't join the construction team.

1006
00:40:10,880 --> 00:40:11,670
Unless...

1007
00:40:12,800 --> 00:40:14,400
Director Wan gives the word.

1008
00:40:14,960 --> 00:40:15,840
Otherwise,

1009
00:40:15,960 --> 00:40:18,220
I really don't have the guts to guide him.

1010
00:40:21,440 --> 00:40:22,110
No matter what,

1011
00:40:22,110 --> 00:40:23,550
I am the deputy director.

1012
00:40:23,840 --> 00:40:24,950
My words...

1013
00:40:25,760 --> 00:40:26,550
Wang.

1014
00:40:27,110 --> 00:40:28,150
How did you make

1015
00:40:28,150 --> 00:40:29,620
these noodles?

1016
00:40:29,840 --> 00:40:31,360
The chili has no aroma,

1017
00:40:31,960 --> 00:40:32,960
and the flavor is so weak.

1018
00:40:32,960 --> 00:40:34,490
It tastes like plain water.

1019
00:40:34,550 --> 00:40:35,760
If the noodles

1020
00:40:36,110 --> 00:40:36,880
are bad,

1021
00:40:36,880 --> 00:40:38,610
you can always buy better ones.

1022
00:40:39,590 --> 00:40:41,010
But some people

1023
00:40:41,110 --> 00:40:43,230
don't even know their own limits

1024
00:40:43,350 --> 00:40:45,550
and still want to tell others what to do.

1025
00:40:46,110 --> 00:40:47,480
Isn't that right,

1026
00:40:47,630 --> 00:40:48,890
Deputy Director Geng?

1027
00:40:55,070 --> 00:40:56,760
I asked Wan Yang today

1028
00:40:56,800 --> 00:40:57,800
to let me lead the team

1029
00:40:57,800 --> 00:40:59,070
repairing the Project 713 pipeline

1030
00:40:59,070 --> 00:41:00,510
and take charge of the new design.

1031
00:41:00,510 --> 00:41:01,510
He agreed.

1032
00:41:01,800 --> 00:41:02,630
I thought

1033
00:41:02,630 --> 00:41:04,290
this would make things easier

1034
00:41:04,360 --> 00:41:05,190
for you and Chen Shan.

1035
00:41:05,190 --> 00:41:05,920
At least

1036
00:41:06,440 --> 00:41:08,590
you can get into the construction site.

1037
00:41:08,590 --> 00:41:09,510
That's great.

1038
00:41:09,630 --> 00:41:11,560
Shan has been worrying about this.

1039
00:41:12,510 --> 00:41:13,970
Congratulations, Mr. Qi.

1040
00:41:14,070 --> 00:41:14,920
Now you have a chance

1041
00:41:14,920 --> 00:41:16,000
to prove yourself.

1042
00:41:17,670 --> 00:41:18,590
To help my mentor

1043
00:41:18,590 --> 00:41:19,450
and to help you,

1044
00:41:19,590 --> 00:41:20,990
our top priority

1045
00:41:21,040 --> 00:41:22,360
is finding the original design blueprints

1046
00:41:22,360 --> 00:41:23,400
she drew up.

1047
00:41:24,110 --> 00:41:25,440
Besides the archives department

1048
00:41:25,440 --> 00:41:27,190
and her sealed office,

1049
00:41:28,550 --> 00:41:30,030
the only copy

1050
00:41:30,030 --> 00:41:31,000
should be in Wan Yang's office.
